:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-harbour-zephyr-link'>>
  <<deadwood-coin-zephyr-link>>
  <<if !maplebirch.get('MoreTransformations') or !$MoreTransformations?.harbour?.ship or !C.npc.Zephyr.init
      or $replayScene or $statFreeze or $frozenValues or $combat or $possessed or $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink [
    $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 3 ? 'Bring up the recovered cargo' : 'Ask about Coldmoon Harbour',
    $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 3 ? '提起找回的货物' : '问问寒月港湾的事'
  ] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr'>>
    <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.origin to $passage>>
    <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 0>><<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage to 1>><</if>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr
<<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Zephyr.init and _harbour.ship and _harbour.zephyr.stage gt 0>>
  <<npc 'Zephyr'>><<person1>>
  <<switch _harbour.zephyr.stage>>
    <<case 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You tell Zephyr about the spectral ship in the blood fog. <<He>> stops smiling, eyes narrowing. "Tattered black sails? Crew with more cold seawater than blood in 'em? Aye... thought I smelled that rot on the wind. Best keep your pockets shut tight around that lot."
          <br><br>
          <<if $zephyr_seen is 'wraith' or visited('Wraith Snatched Pirate Railing 2') gt 0>>
            "And if something calls to ye from the black water again, don't go obliging it." <<He>> taps the brass telescope at <<his>> hip. "Don't make me fish ye out of the foam a second time."
          <<else>>
            "On the night of the bloody sea, keep a sharp eye on what crawls over the rail. And don't go following every sweet whisper ye hear bubbling out of the surf."
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          "They dragged off a choice bit of me cargo last time," <<he>> continues, leaning forward. "A small chest, red cord bound tight round the lid. When that cursed hulk drops anchor, I've seen 'em hauling their plunder under the steps of the old quay." <<He>> studies you over the pewter rim of <<his>> mug. "Fetch it back for me, and I'll make it well worth your sweat."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你向泽菲尔提起海雾里见到的那艘诡异古船。<<He>>收起笑容，眼眸微微眯起：“破烂黑帆？船员皮肉惨白、流出来的海水比血还多？哼……老子就知道风里飘着那股死人味。碰上那帮家伙，最好把你的口袋捂紧点。”
          <br><br>
          <<if $zephyr_seen is 'wraith' or visited('Wraith Snatched Pirate Railing 2') gt 0>>
            “还有，下回再有东西在黑水底下叫唤，别傻乎乎地往里跳。”<<He>>拍了拍腰间的黄铜望远镜，“老子可没闲工夫每次都跳下海捞你。”
          <<else>>
            “血海之夜，给老子把眼睛放亮点，提防爬上船舷的鬼东西。水下冒出来的鬼动静，也别听风就是雨跟着跳。”
          <</if>>
          <br><br>
          “上回这伙死人趁乱拖走了老子一批精细货，”<<he>>凑近了些，压低声音，“一只小沉香木箱，箱盖上扎着猩红的粗绳。那破船靠岸时，老子亲眼瞧见他们把搜刮来的东西往旧防波堤的石阶底下拖。”<<He>>隔着麦酒杯沿打量着你，“给老子找回来，老子绝不会让你白忙活。”
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<if $spear_vessel is 'Zephyr'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            "Ye've a rare knack for dredging up what I fancy. Let's see if that was more than dumb luck." <<His>> grin widens wolfishly. "Leave any other treasures of mine where they lie, mind."
          <<option 'CN'>>
            “你小子倒真有两下子，总能捞到合老子心意的东西。这回倒要看看，你那是真本事还是瞎猫碰上死耗子。”<<He>>咧嘴露出一抹猎犬般的笑容，“丑话说在前头，老子别的宝贝，瞧见了可别动歪心思。”
        <</language>><br><br>
      <</if>>
      <<set $_zephyrFee to $pirate_rank is 1 ? 12000 : 8000>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>"A proper mate earns a proper share."<<else>>"Don't go fancying this makes ye one of me crew. It's a job, pure and simple."<</if>> <<He>> offers you <<printmoney $_zephyrFee>>.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>“正经船员自然有正经的抽成。”<<else>>“可别以为接了这趟差事就算入伙。一码归一码，这就是趟买卖。”<</if>><<He>>答应付你<<printmoney $_zephyrFee>>。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/red-cord-chest.png'>><<lanLink ['Agree to recover the chest', '答应找回箱子'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Deal'>>
        <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 1>>
          <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.fee to $pirate_rank is 1 ? 12000 : 8000>>
          <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage to 2, $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to 'zephyrDeal'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
      <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to $pirate_rank is 1 ? 300 : 400>>
      <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Agree and haggle over your share', '答应找箱子，顺便谈谈价'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Deal'>>
        <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 1>>
          <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to $pirate_rank is 1 ? 300 : 400>>
          <<skulduggerycheck 'silent'>><<skulduggeryuse>>
          <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.fee to ($pirate_rank is 1 ? 12000 : 8000) + ($skulduggerysuccess is 1 ? 4000 : 0)>>
          <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage to 2, $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to $skulduggerysuccess is 1 ? 'zephyrBargain' : 'zephyrRefused'>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><br>
    <<case 2>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Back empty-handed, are ye?" Zephyr raises an eyebrow. "No chest, not a single bloody penny. That's the bargain."
          <br><br>
          <<He>> thumps <<his>> pewter mug onto the table. "Wait till the blood moon drifts that cursed hulk in, then dive beneath the stone steps at Coldmoon Harbour. Follow the rusted mooring chain all the way down. Red cord lashed tight around the lid. And keep your wits about ye—don't let those drowned bastards catch ye poking around their stash."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “两手空空回来的？”泽菲尔挑了挑眉，“没见到老子的箱子，一个铜板也别想拿到。说好的规矩。”
          <br><br>
          <<He>>重重把麦酒杯搁在桌上。“等血月把那艘破船带进港湾，就潜到寒月港湾的石阶底下摸。顺着生锈的系船铁链一路探下去，箱盖上扎着死结红绳。机灵点，可别让那帮淹死的死鬼逮着你在水底翻他们的老底。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 3>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Zephyr's sharp eyes instantly lock onto the dripping little chest. <<He>> reaches out eagerly, but you calmly keep the prize firmly on your side of the table. Zephyr blinks, then bursts into a hearty guffaw. "Aye, sharp as a cutlass and twice as wary! A bargain's a bargain on me ship." <<He>> draws out a thick roll of banknotes, thumbing through them and counting off <<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>>.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          泽菲尔那双锐利的眼眸瞬间锁定了那只滴水的小箱子。<<He>>急不可耐地伸手来拿，你却不动声色地将箱子按在自己身前。泽菲尔一愣，随即放声大笑：“行啊你，手脚够利索，心眼也不少！老子说话算话，一码归一码。”<<He>>爽快地掏出一厚叠钞票，蘸着唾沫麻利地数出<<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>>。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/red-cord-chest.png'>><<lanLink ['Hand over the chest', '交出箱子'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Delivery'>>
        <<if $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage is 3>>
          <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.stage to 4, $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to 'zephyrPaid'>>
          <<money $MoreTransformations.harbour.zephyr.fee>><<npcincr 'Zephyr' love 2>>
          <<if $pirate_rank is 1>><<pirate_status 2 'mate'>><</if>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<gglove>><<if $pirate_rank is 1>><<ggrespect>><</if>><br>
    <<case 4>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Still poking your nose around that old quay?" Zephyr asks with a grin. "Good coin in deep salvage, so long as ye know which cursed rot to leave down in the muck." <<He>> raises <<his>> mug in a toast. "Ye snatched me cargo straight out from under those drowned corpses. Next time some loudmouth calls ye a landlubber, throw that in their ugly mugs."
          <br><br>
          <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>"Word spread among the bilge rats quick enough. Don't go getting a swollen head—there's still decks to swab."<<else>>"As for earning a real berth aboard me vessel? Ye'll prove your salt the hard way like everyone else, fair and square."<</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “还在那处旧码头转悠呢？”泽菲尔咧嘴一笑，“海底捞货确实油水足，只要你小子知道哪些撞邪的玩意儿该让它烂在泥里。”<<He>>豪爽地朝你举了举酒杯，“不过说真的，你能从那帮死人嘴里把老子的货抠回来，够本事的。下回船上哪个碎嘴的说你是个旱鸭子，记得把这桩壮举狠狠砸在他们脸上。”
          <br><br>
          <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>“这帮底舱耗子早传开了。尾巴可别翘上天，甲板上的活儿还多着呢。”<<else>>“至于想彻底入伙上海盗船？嘿，那还得按海盗的规矩拿本事来换，谁来都一样。”<</if>>
      <</language>><br><br>
  <</switch>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'There is no sign of the captain here.' '这里没有船长的踪影。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink [
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Return to the deck' : 'Return to the pub',
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? '返回甲板' : '回到酒吧'
] `_harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Pirate Deck' : 'Smuggler Pub'`>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Deal
<<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Zephyr.init and _harbour.zephyr.stage is 2>>
  <<npc 'Zephyr'>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if _harbour.scene is 'zephyrBargain'>>
        "Charging danger money, are ye?" Zephyr barks with laughter. "Fine by me. But if ye end up drowned at the bottom, I'm drinking your cut myself!"
      <<elseif _harbour.scene is 'zephyrRefused'>>
        "Haggling over a tiny box like that?" Zephyr snorts, folding <<his>> arms. "Me first offer stands. Take it or leave it, your funeral." You agree to the original price.
      <<else>>
        "That's the spirit, mate." Zephyr hoists <<his>> mug. "I'd shake on it, but ye look like you'd charge me extra for the handshake."
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      "Fetch that chest back to me here or aboard ship. Once it's in me hands, <<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>> is yours to keep." <<He>> leans back against the wooden chair. "And if ye hear scratching or thumping from inside while ye're down there, don't go prying the lid open underwater."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if _harbour.scene is 'zephyrBargain'>>
        “还要算上卖命钱是吧？”泽菲尔放声大笑，“行啊，只要你有本事拿命换。你要是淹死在水底，那份钱老子正好留着买酒！”
      <<elseif _harbour.scene is 'zephyrRefused'>>
        “为了这么点小箱子跟我讨价还价？”泽菲尔哼了一声，抱起双臂，“就刚才那个价，爱干不干，随你的便。”你答应按原价办。
      <<else>>
        “这才像样。”泽菲尔豪迈地举了举酒杯，“握手就免了，省得你小子顺杆爬找老子要定金。”
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      “把箱子给老子带回来，在这儿或者船上找我都行。东西一到手，<<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>>一分都少不了你的。”<<He>>往椅背上一靠，“还有，万一在水底下听见箱子里头有什么抓挠敲击的动静，可别手贱去揭盖子。”
  <</language>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You have no new business to settle.' '眼下没有新的买卖要谈。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink [
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Return to the deck' : 'Return to the pub',
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? '返回甲板' : '回到酒吧'
] `_harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Pirate Deck' : 'Smuggler Pub'`>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Zephyr Delivery
<<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Zephyr.init and _harbour.zephyr.stage is 4 and _harbour.scene is 'zephyrPaid'>>
  <<npc 'Zephyr'>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You slide the sodden, heavy chest across the table as you pocket the notes. Zephyr flicks out a seaman's blade and severs the crimson cord, lifting the lid just a crack to peer inside. You catch only a glimpse of oilcloth-wrapped parcels and the dark mouth of a sealed flagon before <<he>> snaps the oak lid firmly shut.
      <br><br>
      "Pitch seal still unbroken. Mighty fine." <<He>> drums thick, calloused knuckles on the lid with satisfaction. "What, eyes popping hoping for Spanish doubloons? To me, this is gold—and it's mine, not yours."
      <br><br>
      <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>"I'll let the crew know who snatched the captain's prize back." <<He>> claps a heavy, weathered hand onto your shoulder with enough force to rattle your ribs.<<else>>"Sharp work! If ye ever do earn a berth on me crew, keep that knack for walking away alive from the dead."<</if>>
      <br><br>
      You safely stash your payment of <<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>>.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你一手交货一手接钱，将沉甸甸的湿木箱推过桌面。泽菲尔拔出腰刀挑断猩红的系绳，小心翼翼地将箱盖掀起一条缝隙往里审视。你只来得及瞥见包裹严实的油布与一截幽暗的细颈玻璃瓶口，木盖便伴随着一声脆响被<<he>>严严实实地拍上了。
      <br><br>
      “火漆封口完好无损，干得漂亮。”<<He>>屈起手指在箱盖上敲出清脆的节奏，“怎么，瞪着大眼以为里面装满了金条？对老子来说，这就是货真价实的宝藏——只不过归老子所有，没你的份儿。”
      <br><br>
      <<if $pirate_rank is 1>>“老子会在甲板上跟所有人说清楚，是谁替船长把货抢回来的。”<<He>>伸出布满老茧的大手，在你的肩膀上重重拍了一掌，震得你骨头发颤。<<else>>“干得利落！哪天你小子要是真被老子抓上船当水手，记得把这副能在死人堆里活着回来的好身手给老子保持住。”<</if>>
      <br><br>
      你妥善收好到手的<<printmoney _harbour.zephyr.fee>>。
  <</language>><<gglove>><<if $pirate_rank is 1>><<ggrespect>><</if>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The captain has already settled your payment.' '船长已经结清了你的报酬。'>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink [
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Return to the deck' : 'Return to the pub',
  _harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? '返回甲板' : '回到酒吧'
] `_harbour.zephyr.origin is 'Pirate Zephyr' ? 'Pirate Deck' : 'Smuggler Pub'`>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</lanLink>><br>
